{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>OnSite Checklists 是一款專為現場稽核與安全檢查設計的智能清單工具，適合建築工程師、安全管理員及設施維護人員使用。現在正值限時免費期間，讓你以零成本體驗原本售價 US $0.99 的專業級應用。</p>\n\n<h2>離線作業與智能報告</h2>\n<p>這款應用支援建立自定義模板，讓用戶在無網路環境下也能進行檢查。它提供是／否／不適用評分系統，並可即時附加照片、註解與電子簽名。完成檢查後，能一鍵生成帶有公司標誌的 PDF 或 Excel 專業報告，大幅提升團隊協作效率與合規文件管理品質，確保每一次稽核都精準且具備法律效力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：OnSite Checklists – Auditing</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:15:06.976926+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}